In this video, I’m making an indulgent Banoffee Pie Ice Cream, combining the rich flavors of bananas, caramel, and graham cracker crust into one creamy dessert! Learn how to create this frozen twist on the classic British dessert step by step, with tips on balancing sweetness, getting the perfect texture, and incorporating pie elements into homemade ice cream.

Whether you’re a food science enthusiast or just love experimenting with unique ice cream flavors, this recipe is for you! Perfect for summer treats, dessert lovers, or anyone who can’t resist a good slice of pie in ice cream form.

🔪 Ingredients:
 • Ripe bananas
 • Dulce de Leche (or any caramel)
 • Graham cracker crumbs (or your fav cookie)
 • And a secret touch for that perfect texture!

